{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/937944-the-walking-dead","id":937944,"title":"The Walking Dead.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-07-26T22:39:14-07:00","id":937944,"title":"The Walking Dead.","content":"I just recently started reading TWD comics after being a longtime fan of the tv show.It is interesting to go back and see the differences between the books and the show.For those of you who read the books and watched the show,my question is, are you happy wit h the way the show has adapted the books or do you wish they were more faithful to the books?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12038-zandarro","name":"zandarro","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-27T00:13:21-07:00","id":937970,"title":"","content":"In general, I'm happy with the direction of the TV show. Hell, even Kirkman has said that the show is essentially benefiting from hindsight of getting to do things better than he did originally with the comics.<br /> <br /> There are a few things I'd wished that been more faithful with, but they're largely small things. For example Lori's death in the comics was, for me, superior.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-27T22:08:41-07:00","id":938601,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/937944-the-walking-dead?p=937970#post937970\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In general, I'm happy with the direction of the TV show. Hell, even Kirkman has said that the show is essentially benefiting from hindsight of getting to do things better than he did originally with the comics.<br /> <br /> There are a few things I'd wished that been more faithful with, but they're largely small things. For example Lori's death in the comics was, for me, superior.</div> </div> </div> </div>I agree.I also liked some of the books portrayals of the characters over the shows. For example,Tyrese,Dale,and Andrea are far better in the books.On the other hand, I like Glenn on the show a lot more than in the books.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12038-zandarro","name":"zandarro","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-27T22:51:41-07:00","id":938617,"title":"","content":"I'm not sure how much you can really compare some of those though. Their arcs are diverge enough that the TV versions can't get to some of the same places as the comics. It would also be kinda.. overlapping in some cases. TV!Carol with Comic!Andrea would be kind of superfluous.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-01T20:37:54-07:00","id":941648,"title":"","content":"While I'm not totally caught up on the comics(I've read all three Compendiums though), I'm pretty happy with the direction of the show. I think there are things that are easier to do in comics than would be on TV, so I can understand some of the changes made.<br /> <br /> I like the way the TV show is going for the most part. Not sure I'm totally happy with the way they cliffhangered this last season though....","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-02T00:16:00-07:00","id":941737,"title":"","content":"I appreciate the choice there myself. It isn't necessarily what I'd do, but I get the idea of the season ending with the big confrontation, and the next season being about the fallout from it, and thus leaving &quot;who&quot; for the next season makes sense. Also cliffhangers are kind of a thing in TV (even if they're growing to be something with less of a point).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}